# Project structure

- Put each business capability under `features/<name>/`.
- The feature entry file composes the feature for consumers.
- Feature-local code may include `types.ts`, `components/`, `hooks/`, `functions/`, and `*.spec.ts` / `*.spec.tsx`.
- Put only reusable UI in `components/` (including `components/ui`).
- One React component per module file.
- Keep business logic out of component files; place it in `hooks/` or `functions/`.
- Write application chrome and documentation in English.
